`BRIDGE_BLOCKED` applies. This package was created locally and was not published to perfume-chem.

## Evidence boundary

The work establishes an inventory/provenance correction and a controlled research path. It does not establish:

- physical liking;
- commercial similarity;
- stability;
- safety or current regulatory compliance;
- measured headspace;
- strict empirical OAV;
- skin performance;
- physical execution;
- release readiness.

All remain `NOT TESTED`, `PENDING`, or `HOLD` as applicable.
